%% 02 security actions. Split at this comment when rendering each diagram.
flowchart TD
    Request["validated request"] --> Context["validate_request_context"]
    Context --> Session["check_session_risk"]
    Session --> Fixed["check_input_policy"]
    Fixed --> MaskIn["mask_personal_data · input"]
    MaskIn --> InputRail["NeMo input rail · local checks by default"]
    InputRail --> Admission["check_generation_admission · bounded queue"]
    Admission --> Reserve["check_request_budget · lock + reservation"]
    Reserve --> Call["await OpenAI · no automatic retry by default"]
    Call --> Usage["settle generation reservation"]
    Usage --> Released["release slot · all exits via finally"]
    Released --> Out["check_output_policy · complete content"]
    Out --> Marketing["check_marketing_response · M endpoints only"]
    Marketing --> MaskOut["mask_personal_data · output"]
    MaskOut --> Bound["validate_request_context · output binding"]
    Bound --> Safe["safe JSON / checked SSE chunks"]
    Session -. BLOCK .-> Deny["safe stop · no later calls"]
    Fixed -. BLOCK .-> Deny
    Reserve -. BLOCK .-> Deny
    Out -. BLOCK .-> Deny
    Deny --> Risk["record_risk_event · policy blocks only"]
    Call -. timeout/disconnect .-> Cleanup["cancel · bounded cleanup · settle once"]
    InputRail -. failure .-> Error["fail closed · technical error"]
    Context -. mismatch .-> Error
    Admission -. overload .-> Error

%% 03 SSE lifecycle. Split at this comment when rendering each diagram.
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as POST fetch reader
    participant F as FastAPI async generator
    participant G as NeMo rails/actions
    participant B as Budget store
    participant A as Admission manager
    participant O as OpenAI async client
    C->>F: validated POST request
    F-->>C: meta (no answer content)
    F->>G: context, input checks and masking
    G-->>F: allow
    F->>A: acquire slot with bounded wait
    F->>B: atomic reserve
    F->>O: await full generation
    O-->>F: full content and usage
    F->>B: settle once
    F->>A: release slot
    F->>G: full output checks and final masking
    G-->>F: safe content with matching request binding
    F-->>C: token events (checked chunks)
    F-->>C: done
    Note over F,A: On failure or disconnect: cleanup reservation, waiter and slot once
    Note over C,G: Policy blocked/error path emits no unchecked answer
